{% endfor %}
Example: `/home/Documents/report.md`, `/home/Desktop/notes.txt`, `/home/Downloads/file.pdf`
Do NOT add extra username directories (e.g. do not use `/home/<username>/...`).

### Terminal (run_command)
Shell commands operate on the real host OS filesystem, NOT the file-operation paths above.
- Do not assume the file-operation paths will work inside shell commands.
- Use real host paths (e.g. `~/Documents/report.md`, `/etc/hosts`) when invoking shell commands.
- Exact working directory and write access depend on runtime security configurations.

